Privacy Policy for the Flax App

General Information

This privacy policy describes how the Flax app collects, processes, and uses personal data. By using the app, you agree to the following terms.

1. Controller

Flax App
Email: support@flaxapp.com

2. Data We Process
	•	Personal Data: Name, email address, profile picture (if provided)
	•	Usage Data: Interactions within the app (likes, posts, comments), usage statistics
	•	Technical Data: Device type, OS, IP address, app version
	•	Cookies & Tracking: For analytics, personalization, and advertising

3. Purpose of Processing
	•	Providing the app (registration, login, posting content)
	•	Security & abuse prevention (protection against spam, fake accounts, illegal content)
	•	Personalization (tailored feeds, recommendations, ads)
	•	Analytics & improvement (bug fixing, optimization, statistics)
	•	Communication (support requests, important updates)

4. Legal Basis (GDPR)
	•	Contract performance (Art. 6 para. 1 lit. b GDPR)
	•	Legitimate interest (security, analysis, prevention of abuse)
	•	Consent (e.g., advertising, push notifications)

5. Data Sharing
	•	We do not sell personal data
	•	Data may be shared with service providers (hosting, cloud, analytics, advertising)
	•	Disclosure to authorities only when legally required

6. Data Retention
	•	Data is stored as long as your account is active or as legally required
	•	Data will be deleted upon request (see below)

7. Your Rights
	•	Access to your stored data
	•	Correction of inaccurate data
	•	Deletion (“right to be forgotten”)
	•	Restriction of processing
	•	Data portability
	•	Objection to processing (e.g., ads)

Contact: support@flaxapp.com

8. Data Deletion

If you want to permanently delete your account and all associated data, send an email with the subject “Delete my data” to support.flax@magenta.de and include the email linked to your account.

9. Changes

We may update this privacy policy at any time. Updates will be posted in the app and on our website.
